+# LF everywhere: this project asserts byte-identical output and hashes metadata
+# files for provenance. core.autocrlf=true on Windows would otherwise flip these
+# to CRLF on checkout and change both the CSV bytes and the metadata hashes.
+*.csv  text eol=lf
+*.py   text eol=lf
+*.yaml text eol=lf
+*.yml  text eol=lf
+*.sql  text eol=lf
+*.md   text eol=lf
+*.json text eol=lf
