+# Phase 3 artifact: Column bindings mapping glossary terms to physical columns
+#
+# This file binds business terms from 03_glossary.yml to actual columns in
+# fact_order_delivery and fact_production_order. These bindings enable the
+# resolver to translate natural language filters and dimensions into SQL.
+#
+# CRITICAL: All columns referenced here must exist in the warehouse.
+# A test validates every binding against PRAGMA table_info().
+#
+# scope: business  -- the term is defined in 03_glossary.yml, so a user can name it
+#                     in natural language and the resolver can bind it.
+# scope: internal  -- a physical column the compiler reads (variances, flags, raw phase
+#                     timestamps). Deliberately NOT in the glossary: exposing 27 more
+#                     terms to the resolver widens the guess space without answering a
+#                     question anyone asks. A test enforces that every business-scoped
+#                     binding has a glossary entry, so this stays a decision rather
+#                     than drift.
